#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-C expect=violation domain=ADDL
#note "NEW with the M2-P5 ruling (option (a), Fix #305) - the -C mirror of PMDA-AD0252-B-invalid_device_level_dataset-ADDL, and the pin that the second half of the widening landed. AVALCA1N seeds one expansion (y=1) on a DEVICE LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET, which was out of scope until the token joined Scope.Data_Structures.Include. Dataset granularity -> exactly 1 violation for the two rows, reported at row=1 by the BroadcastFold dataset-level path, with the expanded Output_Variable resolved by value from data row 1."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 AVALCA1N=1
dataset ADDL structure="DEVICE LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col SPDEVID  type=Char
col AVALCA1N type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | DEV01 | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | DEV02 | 2
